# 必考词 Unit 15 短语

## 常考短语

- **in harmony with**: 与…和谐 — We should live in harmony with nature. 我们应该与自然和谐共处。
- **harsh reality**: 严酷的现实 — The harsh reality is that not everyone can succeed. 严酷的现实是并非每个人都能成功。
- **a health hazard**: 健康危害 — Air pollution is a serious health hazard. 空气污染是严重的健康危害。
- **highlight the importance of**: 强调…的重要性 — The report highlights the importance of education. 报告强调了教育的重要性。
- **take a hint**: 领会暗示 — He didn't take the hint and kept talking. 他没领会暗示，继续说个不停。
- **on the horizon**: 在地平线上；即将来临 — A new era is on the horizon. 一个新时代即将来临。
- **be hostile to/toward**: 对…有敌意 — The local people were hostile to outsiders. 当地人对外来者有敌意。
- **household name**: 家喻户晓的名字 — The brand has become a household name. 这个品牌已成为家喻户晓的名字。
- **a humble beginning**: 卑微的出身 — Many successful people came from humble beginnings. 许多成功人士出身卑微。
- **be identical to/with**: 与…完全相同 — The copy is identical to the original. 副本与原件完全相同。
- **identify with**: 认同 — Readers can identify with the main character. 读者可以认同主角。
- **in ignorance of**: 不知道 — He acted in ignorance of the rules. 他在不了解规则的情况下行事。
- **illustrate a point**: 说明一个观点 — The example illustrates a key point. 这个例子说明了一个关键观点。
- **have an impact on**: 对…有影响 — Technology has had a huge impact on our lives. 技术对我们的生活产生了巨大影响。
- **implement a plan**: 实施计划 — The government implemented the reform plan. 政府实施了改革计划。
- **impose…on**: 把…强加于 — The government imposed restrictions on imports. 政府对进口实施了限制。
- **be impressed by/with**: 对…印象深刻 — I was impressed by her performance. 我对她的表现印象深刻。
- **on impulse**: 一时冲动 — She quit her job on impulse. 她一时冲动辞了工作。
- **be inclined to**: 倾向于 — I'm inclined to believe his story. 我倾向于相信他的故事。
- **indicate that**: 表明 — Evidence indicates that the plan is working. 证据表明计划正在发挥作用。
